21	 * 150050 -> 'RM 1,500.50', -500 -> '-RM 5.00'. Built from integer division
22	 * instead of Intl.NumberFormat so the text is byte-identical on every
23	 * runtime/ICU build (no NBSP surprises, no hydration mismatch).
